SDV simple:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP 150ms+/-10ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, DL 30ms+/-10ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (period 100ms+/-1ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, AD 30ms+/-10ms)    
App :
    Component AEB_controler :
        Service S1:
            subscribe to var VSS signal Camera
            publish to VSS signal Brake
            period 200ms+/-10ms offset 10ms+/-0ms
            execution 50ms+/-15ms using cpu0
            nonreentrant

Resource:
    Execution cpu0

Functional Chains:
    chain : Camera -> Brake